      "body": "## Motivation\n\nSeveral docs pages link to repo files that were moved or deleted, so the links return 404 on GitHub.\n\n## Modifications\n\n- `docs/docs/supported-models/support_new_models.mdx`: `test_generation_models.py` moved from `test/registered/models/` to `test/registered/e2e/models/`, so the link now points there. That file no longer has an `ALL_OTHER_MODELS` list (its own docstring says to add new models to `ALL_MODELS`), so I updated the list name too.\n- `docs/cookbook/autoregressive/GLM/GLM-5.3-Flash.mdx`: the `compute-mamba-ratio` skill is at `.agents/skills/compute-mamba-ratio/SKILL.md`. Nothing exists under `.claude/skills/`.\n- `docs/docs/references/multi_node_deployment/lws_pd/lws_pd_deploy.mdx`: the `lws-examples/*.yaml` files were deleted in the Mintlify cutover (#28964). Each manifest is already shown inline right below its heading, so I removed the five dead links and kept the filenames as plain text. The prefill and decode files were called `prefill.yaml` / `decode.yaml` while the deploy step runs `kubectl apply -f p.yaml` / `d.yaml`, so they're now named `p.yaml` / `d.yaml` to match.\n\nThese are docs-only changes. Every new link target was checked against current `main`, and a scan of the repo's `.md`/`.mdx` files finds no other `github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/main/...` links that point to missing files.\n\nAI assistance was used to find and make these edits. I reviewed the diff.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nN/A (docs only)\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nN/A (docs only)\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format your code according to the [Format code with pre-commit](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#format-code-with-pre-commit).\n- [ ] Add unit tests according to the [Run and add unit tests](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#run-and-add-unit-tests). (docs only)\n- [x] Update documentation according to [Write documentations](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_